  "goodToKnow": "Die Kondition is a false friend. In the singular, it usually means physical fitness or stamina: eine gute Kondition haben, Konditionstraining. In the plural, Konditionen are terms or conditions of a deal: Kreditkonditionen, zu günstigen Konditionen. For the condition of an object, German says der Zustand: Das Auto ist in gutem Zustand. Conditions as requirements are Bedingungen. Plural: die Konditionen."
